      "assumption": "Shares outstanding remain constant at 1,47,10,764 throughout the forecast period with zero dilution",
      "failure_scenario": "To fund the working-capital requirements implied by a tripling of revenue, the company undertakes a QIP or rights issue, or exercises ESOPs, expanding the share count by 10-15% and reducing EPS materially below the forecast figures even if revenue and net income targets are achieved",
      "risk": "Medium"
    }
